There are three versions of our virtual pet. Each version has approximately 
the same functionality, but there are minor differences in their source code 
and Makefiles, so we placed each version in their own folder.   

Text-only: no GUI, can only interact with the pet through the terminal.
	   More explicit multi-threading than the other versions.  

GUI: an image of the pet is displayed in a separate window. The images 
     change depending on how the user interacts with the pet. For 
     example, cleaning the pet will show an image of the pet with 
     bubbles in the background. 

